        "TileImage": "$($repository 672a7a52-a08a-45cd-a061-ced6a7b8d8c4).Image",
        "Description": "47, I know you aren&apos;t aquanted with the suburban lifestyle, but it isn&apos;t all that it&apos;s cracked up to be. The neighbor who seems to jog for a living but really just does it for social media. The constant on-going road work that won&apos;t end in your lifetime. The new house development that will skyrocket the neighborhoods property taxes. The self proclaimed &quot;cook of the neighborhood&quot; who thinks he rules the block with his parties. And finally, some old russian nobody. You know what to do 47.",
